@page "/learn-more"
@model Showheel.Pages.LearnMoreModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Skies Beyond the Star | Learn More";
}

<section class="novel-showcase-page">
    <div class="novel-hero">
        <div class="novel-title">Skies Beyond the Star</div>
        <div class="novel-title-cn">星 外 之 穹</div>
        <div class="novel-subtitle">A science fiction novel set 521 years after humanity's loneliest colony lost contact with Earth.</div>
        <div class="novel-tagline">"On a terraformed world orbiting an orange star, one million people build a civilization from the bones of the machines that brought them here."</div>
    </div>

    <div class="novel-section">
        <h2>The World of Archeon</h2>
        <p>Archeon is a sub-Earth-sized planet in a K2V star system, roughly 520 light-years from Earth. In the 25th century, an autonomous terraforming package — the CI (Colonial Infrastructure) — arrived and spent 30 years reshaping the continent of Aethelgard into a habitable zone.</p>
        <p>Then, in 2506, Betelgeuse went supernova just 7 light-years away. The electromagnetic storm severed all interstellar communication. No more ships. No more signals. Earth became a memory.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="novel-section">
        <h2>Concept Art &amp; World Design</h2>
        <p class="novel-section-intro">Visual development for settings, characters, and atmosphere. Concept art produced with Midjourney, visual direction by the author.</p>

        <div class="art-grid">
            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.run3WFQs2RBNwk_httpss.mj.runTdlkulx-xT4_e80f318a-debb-4d1e-951e-034b4780b6c4_2.png" alt="Character portrait concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Anna Freedman</div>
                    <p>Airship mechanic, pilot, and the story's protagonist.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.run8TAait7Gpf4_httpss.mj.runDJEKszGoAow_a881da49-3729-4599-857d-6a4317e78d29_2%20(1).png" alt="Frontier city concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Frontier City — Capital</div>
                    <p>Archeon's largest settlement and the hub of its airship network.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.runMh_LMzE2cSY_a_retro_future_large_out_bf8f0f61-d5d3-494e-8970-a5f7b2e4578f_3.png" alt="Market district at dusk concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">The Brass Quarter</div>
                    <p>The market district layered over the CI-era architecture.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.runXO66Cy_W7fw_in_the_style_of_makoto_s_bf51706f-9fc0-46d2-8c56-8cff992e6422_0.png" alt="Upper Frontier walkways concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Upper Frontier — Walkways</div>
                    <p>Elevated paths connecting repurposed towers above the markets.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.runYlccy6EBBg8_httpss.mj.runnsG5gFSP7bA_24e6e01b-0e29-4e48-838e-1d8427c676d6_2.png" alt="Thread Festival concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Thread Festival</div>
                    <p>Archeon's annual celebration of the Loom craft network.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.runZwKGXm_bCQM_httpss.mj.runYqdYy9dwsAQ_e9a9000c-03c1-4ed4-ac18-86a0a2c0feba_1.png" alt="Vertical farms concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Vertical Farms — Frontier City</div>
                    <p>Hydroponic gardens woven directly into old building shells.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/u2512543951_httpss.mj.runshte0coPeJM_httpss.mj.runhksHaJ5tLeA_ed8a8b21-872d-419c-8ca0-021bcca0c234_3.png" alt="Orun Plateau edge concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Orun Plateau Edge — Outpost</div>
                    <p>A cliffside waypoint connecting the basin and southern frontier.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="art-card">
                <img src="/images/QQ20251107-035209.png" alt="Atheria canyon concept art" />
                <div class="art-caption">
                    <div class="art-label">Atheria Canyon System</div>
                    <p>Canyon routes where mechanics keep Archeon's infrastructure alive.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
